@nsobid-909E904AF78AC1B8DEEFE97AB2CCDB51968F0EC7

# The Legend of Zelda: Link's Awakening [01006BB00C6F0000] (XCI with update; Eden prints "Update v0.1.0")
# 4:3 Aspect Ratio + HUD fit - RomCore. Eden handheld (guest 1280x720 buffer), RomCore stretches the picture 4/3 vertically.
#
# 1) 016AFBA4: shared float constant 16/9 (0x3FE38E39) -> 4/3 (0x3FAAAAAB). Used by the game camera update (code 0x10b58, 0x1092c, ...)
#    as projection aspect; vertical FOV unchanged, 3D view = centre 4:3 of the 16:9 view.
# 2) 13 camera-default records (mov w,#0x8e39 ; movk w,#0x3fe3,lsl#16 -> 0xaaab / 0x3faa) so every camera type defaults to 4/3.
# 3) 011674B0 -> cave 01433900 (zero padding after .text): hook on nn::ui2d Pane::CalculateMtx (code 0x11674b0).
#    - top root pane (1280x720 layout): height 720->960, scale.y 0.75 (layout space 1280x960, undistorted after the host stretch);
#      nested "RootPane" (HUD part layout inside the pause layout) is reset to 720/1.0 so it is not scaled twice.
#    - full-screen panes (w>=1200, h 560..760): enlarged x4/3 with pivot compensation (backdrops, fade, blur masks cover 4:3).
#    - HUD anchoring: panes with all ancestors near the layout centre (|local ty|<60) and not inside N_Page_0x (pause pages) are moved
#      outward up to 90 world units (ramp |gy| 120..250) so hearts/items/rupees/dialogue/hints sit at the real screen edges.
@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

@enabled
